@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title room_calendars (one room, one night)
[*] --> AVAILABLE
AVAILABLE --> HELD : customer books (15-minute hold)
HELD --> BOOKED : payment confirmed
HELD --> AVAILABLE : hold expired
BOOKED --> AVAILABLE : cancelled, refund approved, early check-out or no-show (nights from today)
BOOKED --> BOOKED : check-in moves the remaining nights to another room of the type
AVAILABLE --> BLOCKED : partner closes the night
BLOCKED --> AVAILABLE : partner reopens the night
legend bottom
AVAILABLE is the absence of a row (or an AVAILABLE row); releasing a night deletes its row.
Nights already passed stay BOOKED as the history of the stay.
endlegend
@enduml